  expr_cpp_err_sizeof_parens.pcpp - break step of expr_cpp.pcpp:
  sizeof without parentheses (PR0045)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\expr_cpp_err_sizeof_parens.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\expr_cpp_err_sizeof_parens.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
